---
import { site } from '../../data/site';
---
<section id="school">
  <div class="investigate-pattern" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="section-header fade-up">
    <span class="section-number t-label">01</span>
    <div>
      <h2 class="section-title">The<br>School</h2>
      <p class="section-intro">
        If machines are learning, what are we teaching them? School of Tomorrow’s AI explores the questions emerging from the technologies we create: what is intelligence, what is human, what is alive, and what might become possible when these questions take material form?
      </p>
      <p class="callout">
        An independent atelier for experimental research — founded in {site.founded} by Lina Lopes in {site.locationLine}.
      </p>
      <div class="section-actions">
        <a href="/about/" class="button button--primary">Read about the School</a>
        <a href={site.founderUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="button button--primary">Lina Lopes &#x2197;&#xFE0E;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
